{"symbol":"ROJL","yahoo":"ROJL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"RO Jewels Limited","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Luxury Goods","website":"https://rojewels.co.in","about":"RO Jewels Limited is involved in wholesaling and trading of gold and silver chains in India. It offers traditional, Indo-western, and modern jewellery, including gold-based chains and bracelets; and gold/silver bars and necklaces, as well as mangalsutra, bangles, and vertical mala. The Company also offers BIS-hallmarked jewellery sourced from BIS-recognized assaying and hallmarking centres. The company sells products through its showroom; and through its marketing and sales team to other jewelry stores. RO Jewels Limited was incorporated in 2018 and is based in Ahmedabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:53:26+00:00","quote":{"price":1.51,"prevClose":1.52,"marketCap":7.62,"high52":2.25,"low52":1.1,"pe":null,"bookValue":2.62,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":5.0446,"insiders":13.43,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2020-03-25","2020-03-26","2020-03-27","2020-03-30","2020-03-31","2020-04-01","2020-04-03","2020-04-07","2020-04-08","2020-04-09","2020-04-13","2020-04-15","2020-04-16","2020-04-17","2020-04-20","2020-04-21","2020-04-22","2020-04-23","2020-04-24","2020-04-27","2020-04-28","2020-04-29","2020-04-30","2020-05-04","2020-05-05","2020-05-06","2020-05-07","2020-05-08","2020-05-11","2020-05-12","2020-05-13","2020-05-14","2020-05-15","2020-05-18","2020-05-19","2020-05-20","2020-05-21","2020-05-22","2020-05-26","2020-05-27","2020-05-28","2020-05-29","2020-06-01","2020-06-02","2020-06-03","2020-06-04","2020-06-05","2020-06-08","2020-06-09","2020-06-10","2020-06-11","2020-06-12","2020-06-15","2020-06-16","2020-06-17","2020-06-18","2020-06-19","2020-06-22","2020-06-23","2020-06-24","2020-06-25","2020-06-26","2020-06-29","2020-06-30","2020-07-01","2020-07-02","2020-07-03","2020-07-06","2020-07-07","2020-07-08","2020-07-09","2020-07-10","2020-07-13","2020-07-14","2020-07-15","2020